### TeX resources

Tectonic resolves LaTeX packages from the **Tectonic default bundle**
(`https://relay.fullyjustified.net/default_bundle_v33.tar`), a repackaging of
TeX Live produced by the Tectonic project. Those files are downloaded lazily,
only for the packages a document actually loads, and cached under
`<runtimeDir>/cache`. Their licenses are the individual TeX Live package
licenses; the bundle index is published by the Tectonic project. This
repository contains none of them.

The `win32-x64` Windows GNU build published by Tectonic is deliberately **not**
used: it is dynamically linked against a MinGW runtime that the release archive
does not ship, so it fails with `STATUS_DLL_NOT_FOUND` on a clean machine.
